      "message_uk": "Академічний огляд залишив зауваження до готової роботи.",
      "detail": "PASS\nCoherent, well-structured academic work on digital workplace surveillance under Art. 4 Statuto and GDPR. Clear research question, sound methodology, four logical chapters. Citations consistently support claims and match the bibliography. Notably, the author is transparent about evidentiary limits, repeatedly flagging where the provided literature does not permit granular reconstruction of statutory text, case law, or Garante decisions—this honesty is a strength rather than a defect. Minor concern: some citations (Angiolini & Cremona) appear in a limits-disclaimer without substantive engagement, and heavy reliance on paraphrased excerpts is acknowledged. No fabricated authority detected; conclusions are appropriately measured. Acceptable as a scholarly review.",
